VIEWMODEL.md §3.2, G6: an enum view takes member items only; anything else is E1627 (enum).
-- a/a.canon --
package a

local enum Rarity { common, rare }

view Rarity {
  title "Rarity"
  common "Common"
  group main "Main" { rare }
  plural "rarities"
}
-- findings.txt --
error[E1627]  a/a.canon:6:3
  title is not allowed in the view of this enum

error[E1627]  a/a.canon:8:3
  group is not allowed in the view of this enum

error[E1627]  a/a.canon:9:3
  plural is not allowed in the view of this enum

3 errors, 0 warnings in 1 package (…)
